#: __init__.py:3
msgid "Export OMI_physics_body and OMI_physics_shape glTF extensions for Godot 4.x (replaces deprecated OMI_collider). Supports primitive collision shapes: box, sphere, cylinder, capsule, convex, trimesh. Includes a non-uniform-scale validator + baker because Godot's CollisionShape3D warns and misbehaves on non-uniform scale. Viewport sidebar UI with collapsible Analyze/Body/Shape panels."
msgstr "为 Godot 4.x 导出 OMI_physics_body 和 OMI_physics_shape glTF 扩展（取代已弃用的 OMI_collider）。支持基元碰撞形状：盒体、球体、圆柱体、胶囊体、凸包、三角网格。包含非均匀缩放校验器与烘焙器，因为 Godot 的 CollisionShape3D 在非均匀缩放下会发出警告并出错。视图侧栏界面，含可折叠的“分析/刚体/形状”面板。"

#: __init__.py:753
msgid "Exports:"
msgstr "导出："

