msgid "Reset the collision shape's dimensions to sane defaults (box=1,1,1; sphere=0.5; cylinder=0.5/1.0; capsule=0.5/1.0). Useful after editing the object's mesh if you don't want to re-run Auto-Fit."
msgstr "将碰撞形状的尺寸重置为合理默认值（盒=1,1,1；球=0.5；圆柱=0.5/1.0；胶囊=0.5/1.0）。在编辑物体网格后不想重新运行自动适配时很有用。"

#: __init__.py:1001
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Reset to Defaults"
